<h1>Join <%= @organization.name %></h1>

<p>Hello,</p>

<p>You've been invited to join <strong><%= @organization.name %></strong>.</p>

<p>Click the link below to sign up and accept your invitation:</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Accept Invitation", @signup_url %>
</p>

<p>Or copy and paste this URL into your browser:</p>
<pre><%= @signup_url %></pre>

<p>If you already have an account, please log in first.</p>

<p>If you didn't request this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.</p>